  pages={1-3},
  abstract={A high voltage (4.8 V), high efficiency (85 %), high density $\left(4 ~\mathrm{A} / \text{mm}^{2}\right.$ incl. passives), 16 nm Stackable Hybrid FIVR (SHFIVR) converter operating at $>25 \text{MHz}$ with an in-package magnetic inductor (3.8 nH) is proposed. The SH-FIVR utilizes a series-input and parallel-output configuration with automatic voltage and current sharing to provide a modular solution for AI accelerators. This is the highest input voltage FIVR reported to date with compelling efficiency and density.},
